// library_exec_no_foreign_discharges.strata -- T-0223 litmus: a
// foreign-less LIBRARY model (no node in the model is declared `trust
// foreign`) whose only node declares `may "exec"`. CWE-78's THREAT003
// obligation still FIRES (`_fired_obligations` joins on the capability
// alone, docs/strata/threat.md#capabilities-drag-in-obligations) but
// discharges CLEANLY via the EXISTING chokepoint machinery:
// `_discharges_as_chokepoint` accepts a `NoFlow(src="foreign",
// dst=node_id)` claim naming the `foreign` TRUST LEVEL directly (not a
// specific node), and `_claims.py::_expand` resolves that to
// `facts.nodes_at("foreign")` -- the empty tuple here, since no node
// carries that trust. `_eval_noflow`'s witness search then has no `src`
// to iterate at all, so it proves the `NoFlow` FORALL vacuously (no
// unendorsed influence path exists, because there is no foreign source in
// the model to originate one): "no foreign source -> no injection path ->
// obligation discharged by absence," proven by the SAME closure walk
// every other NoFlow claim uses -- no new discharge channel needed
// (docs/strata/threat.md#library-mode-discharge-by-absence).
//
// This is a REAL (non-`assume`) `assert` claim, not a human-owned TCB
// entry: the vacuous PROVED verdict is the closure engine's own finding
// over THIS model, so it automatically re-refutes the moment a real
// foreign source is added and reaches `runner` with no boundary --
// library_exec_foreign_reaches_still_fires.strata proves that half, with
// the identical claim shape, so THREAT003 is never weakened for a model
// that DOES have a real injection path.
//
// tested end to end (parse -> elaborate -> check_discharge_completeness)
// by tests/unit/strata/test_threat.py::TestLibraryModeForeignlessDischarge.

module library_exec_no_foreign_discharges

node runner : trusted {
    clearance Internal;
    may "exec";
}

assert "weakness:CWE-78:runner" noflow foreign -> runner

// frob:waive REF002 reason="litmus fixture read by exactly one dedicated test module by design (T-0145/T-0255/T-0256/T-0262/T-0172/T-0154/T-0155/T-0223/T-0226 litmus suites); a second consumer would not be genuine"
